        "notes": "Single infusion at the low end of the saccharification range, favouring beta amylase, for a more fermentable wort and a drier, lighter-bodied beer.  Suitable for most modern well-modified malts.\n\nWater amounts and temperatures depend on the recipe, so are not set here.  To use this profile, select it on a recipe's Mash tab and click \"Calculate Water…\".  (As the profile is locked, you will be asked whether to make a copy for the recipe, which you can then change as you wish.)",
