        },
        "notes": "Full-volume mash with no sparge, eg for brew-in-a-bag (BIAB) or some all-in-one systems: all the water goes into the mash.  The mash out is by direct heat.\n\nWater amounts and temperatures depend on the recipe, so are not set here.  To use this profile, select it on a recipe's Mash tab and click \"Calculate Water…\".  (As the profile is locked, you will be asked whether to make a copy for the recipe, which you can then change as you wish.)",
