          "value": 20
        },
        "notes": "Infusion step mash for less well-modified malts, or grain bills with a lot of wheat, oats or other adjuncts.  Starts thick, with each later step raised by adding boiling water.\n\nWater amounts and temperatures depend on the recipe, so are not set here.  To use this profile, select it on a recipe's Mash tab and click \"Calculate Water…\".  (As the profile is locked, you will be asked whether to make a copy for the recipe, which you can then change as you wish.)",
        "mash_steps": [
          {
            "name": "Protein rest",
            "step_type": "infusion",
            "water_grain_ratio": {
